# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A Soroban NFT contract scaffolded by [Sorobix](https://github.com/Soro-Bix/soroban-scaffold).

## Template: NFT (ERC-721 style)

Minimal non-fungible token contract with:

- `initialize(admin, name, symbol)`
- `mint(to, uri)` — sequential token ids, admin-gated
- `owner_of(id)` / `token_uri(id)` metadata lookup
- Instance storage for collection metadata

## Prerequisites

- Rust 1.76+ with `wasm32-unknown-unknown` target
- [Soroban CLI](https://developers.stellar.org/docs/build/smart-contracts/getting-started/setup)

## Build

```bash
cargo build --target wasm32-unknown-unknown --release
cargo test
```
